@@ -0,0 +1,12 @@
+## Context
+
+See proposal.md. `priceOrder` passes the gross total to `couponDiscount`; `Coupons.redeemable` rejects when `date >= validUntil`.
+
+## Decisions
+
+- Compute the coupon on the sum of the after-volume line amounts (already computed in `priceOrder`); the cap logic still receives the gross total. Smallest change, matches README.
+- Change the expiry check to `> 0`. The minimum-amount check is already given the after-volume subtotal by the caller; the apply step verifies this.
+
+## Risks / Trade-offs
+
+- Orders priced before the fix are not recomputed.
