@@ -0,0 +1,20 @@
+## Why
+
+Two reports show the code disagreeing with the README business rules: a percentage coupon is computed on the gross amount instead of the subtotal after volume discounts (finance: 12 notebooks at €5.00 with a 10% coupon give €48.00 of goods, expected €48.60), and a coupon is refused on its last valid day (Luca: AUTUMN refused on 30 November).
+
+## What Changes
+
+- A percentage coupon takes its percentage off the subtotal after volume discounts, not off the gross amount.
+- A coupon is redeemable on its last day (`validUntil`), inclusive.
+- Not changed: shipping VAT (report 3, Anna). The README states shipping is subject to 22% VAT; dropping it is a business-rule change that needs an owner decision, so it is left as is and flagged.
+
+## Capabilities
+
+### New Capabilities
+- `coupons`: coupon validity period and the base a coupon discount is computed on.
+
+### Modified Capabilities
+
+## Impact
+
+- `src/pricing.ts` (coupon base), `src/coupons.ts` (expiry comparison); tests in `test/`.
